# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in a personal NASA API key (ISS-009).
#
# The game runs without this file: it falls back to NASA's shared DEMO_KEY, then
# to NOAA SWPC's live feed, then to famous past flares marked approximate.
#
# Get a key at https://api.nasa.gov. Vite exposes only variables prefixed with
# VITE_ to the browser, which is why the name below looks like this.
#
# `.env*` files are git-ignored (ISS-006). Do not commit a key.
VITE_NASA_API_KEY=
